WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Transcriber: Méline Adr
Reviewer: Manlin Fang

00:00:07.836 --> 00:00:14.236
I'm Chloe and I'm a journalist, gender
equality campaigner and poet.

00:00:14.916 --> 00:00:21.476
I'm also a feminist. I've been a feminist
for a big chunk of my life now,

00:00:21.756 --> 00:00:24.236
nearly half of it. Now I'm 29.

00:00:25.076 --> 00:00:28.596
I was inspired by the men and
women I grew up around,

00:00:28.596 --> 00:00:32.916
and their beliefs shaped me, but
so did the world around me.

00:00:34.236 --> 00:00:39.476
Feminism, to me is about gender equality
and the fight for women

00:00:39.476 --> 00:00:41.436
and marginalised genders to have that.

00:00:42.396 --> 00:00:47.516
It pushes against traditional gender roles
introduced by colonial powers,

00:00:48.036 --> 00:00:52.956
which harms all members of society. Yes,
even men in power.

00:00:54.316 --> 00:00:59.156
I believe that the world we live in is
one that needs people loudly fighting

00:00:59.156 --> 00:01:02.996
against misogyny and trying to combat
violence against women and girls.

00:01:03.476 --> 00:01:05.636
Because it is an epidemic.

00:01:06.916 --> 00:01:12.676
Over my career, almost by accident,
I've become one of those people.

00:01:13.636 --> 00:01:17.436
It often hasn't felt like a choice
because it feels so necessary.

00:01:18.196 --> 00:01:23.836
How could I watch on and do nothing when
every minute of every day in the UK,

00:01:23.836 --> 00:01:28.996
the police receive a phone call about
domestic violence in which 89% of

00:01:28.996 --> 00:01:32.116
the victims are women being
abused by a man.

00:01:33.836 --> 00:01:36.956
This summer, this need was confirmed.

00:01:38.276 --> 00:01:40.036
We saw Kyle Clifford charged with

00:01:40.036 --> 00:01:43.396
the murders of Carol Hannah
and Louise Hunt.

00:01:44.596 --> 00:01:50.396
We saw the media call him a nice guy
focused more on Carol's husband than her.

00:01:50.796 --> 00:01:54.516
They tried to say that crossbows were
the problem, not male violence.

00:01:55.996 --> 00:01:59.756
I felt sick as I followed the
case of Giselle Pennicott,

00:02:00.076 --> 00:02:03.796
who is currently fighting not only
her assailants but the system.

00:02:04.636 --> 00:02:07.676
She was routinely drugged unconscious
by her husband

00:02:07.676 --> 00:02:11.236
and raped by more than 50 men,
some of whom she knew.

00:02:13.196 --> 00:02:16.316
I cried when I read about the
murder of Rebecca Cheptegei,

00:02:17.196 --> 00:02:20.876
who was set alight by an ex-partner
in front of her child.

00:02:22.276 --> 00:02:24.716
She just returned from the Olympics.

00:02:26.676 --> 00:02:31.156
I've covered these three cases and ones
like them for places like glamour,

00:02:31.156 --> 00:02:34.996
Marie Claire, stylist Grazia, Women's
Health and many more.

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:40.516
I become a go to feminist voice in British
media, appearing on Women's Hour,

00:02:40.516 --> 00:02:43.516
radio one five live and others.

00:02:44.756 --> 00:02:48.916
I also have a platform called EFF Girls
Club which educates against misogyny.

00:02:50.476 --> 00:02:55.716
Now, in doing this work, I come up against
the same label again and again.

00:02:56.596 --> 00:03:00.156
Misandrist. Undressed. I'm
told that I hate men.

00:03:01.156 --> 00:03:03.956
I'm told that my love for women
and marginalized genders,

00:03:03.956 --> 00:03:06.996
and my passion for our safety,
means that I hate men.

00:03:07.876 --> 00:03:09.996
This is categorically not true.

00:03:10.716 --> 00:03:13.956
My feminism is also for
the benefit of boys

00:03:13.956 --> 00:03:17.316
and men who are harmed by misogynistic
socialization,

00:03:17.716 --> 00:03:20.516
whether or not they choose
to accept this reality.

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:27.716
Now, as I said, in doing this work, I have
built a bit of a public profile.

00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:30.676
And sadly, but unsurprisingly,

00:03:30.676 --> 00:03:35.156
this has resulted in a huge amount of
misogynistic abuse directed at me.

00:03:36.236 --> 00:03:38.636
When a piece of my writing goes viral,

00:03:38.636 --> 00:03:42.276
I can expect at least one death
threat a week in my DMs

00:03:42.276 --> 00:03:44.636
and thousands of abusive messages.

00:03:45.476 --> 00:03:49.476
My appearance picked apart, my
intelligence is questioned,

00:03:49.516 --> 00:03:54.556
my safety threatened. So I say I know
quite a lot about misogyn.

00:03:54.556 --> 00:03:57.196
And misandry, although it’s a 
lesser known word

00:03:57.196 --> 00:04:01.396
and some of you might not think this
sounds relevant to you. Trust me, it is.

00:04:01.436 --> 00:04:05.276
It's become the go to clapback from
people who want to silence women

00:04:05.316 --> 00:04:07.516
discussing misogyny and patriarchy.

00:04:07.836 --> 00:04:10.316
They use it as an Uno reverse card,

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:11.956
flipping the narrative back on us

00:04:11.956 --> 00:04:15.316
and implying that actually it's
feminists who are the problem.

00:04:16.596 --> 00:04:18.876
So I wanted to share some
of the messages I get,

00:04:18.876 --> 00:04:21.156
and these are the sanitized ones.

00:04:21.276 --> 00:04:25.196
I’m often told that misogyny isn’t real.

00:04:26.116 --> 00:04:28.596
That women have all the power nowadays.

00:04:29.796 --> 00:04:31.316
They tell me I'm a misandrist,

00:04:31.316 --> 00:04:34.596
and that's dangerous because more
men than women get murdered.

00:04:34.876 --> 00:04:38.036
They don't mention that it's
men doing the murdering.

00:04:39.796 --> 00:04:44.116
The irony is clearly lost on them
that they are partaking in

00:04:44.116 --> 00:04:46.636
the same misogynistic violence
they claim isn't real.

00:04:48.116 --> 00:04:52.516
It's also lost on them that fighting
misogyny leads to better educational

00:04:52.516 --> 00:04:56.076
attainment and mental health
among boys in school.

00:04:56.156 --> 00:04:59.676
So throughout my career, and because of
the messages I received like this,

00:04:59.676 --> 00:05:04.796
I feel that I'm qualified to say the
following. Misandry is not a threat.

00:05:05.476 --> 00:05:08.316
At its worst, it hurts
some men's feelings.

00:05:09.556 --> 00:05:16.396
Misogyny, on the other hand, kills
women daily. One is a structure.

00:05:16.436 --> 00:05:23.276
The other is a reaction. Misandry at
present is only a reaction to misogyny.

00:05:24.556 --> 00:05:27.996
So let's look at the four B movement
in South Korea, for example.

00:05:28.836 --> 00:05:30.676
It was born around five years ago,

00:05:30.676 --> 00:05:35.556
and it's based on four principles where
women reject heterosexual childbirth,

00:05:35.556 --> 00:05:39.036
marriage, dating and sexual
relationships with men.

00:05:40.916 --> 00:05:46.676
In 2016, intimate partner violence was
recorded at 41.5% in South Korea.

00:05:48.156 --> 00:05:53.316
This statistic makes it clear to me the
reasoning behind the four B movement.

00:05:53.676 --> 00:05:56.116
It is a reaction to misogyny.

00:05:56.876 --> 00:06:01.156
However, many have dubbed it as misandrist
, as a hatred of men.

00:06:01.916 --> 00:06:08.356
This is not true. When we look at incels,
I imagine you will think about men,

00:06:08.356 --> 00:06:14.396
right? Well, by definition, there are
also women who are involuntary celibate,

00:06:14.436 --> 00:06:20.636
aka incels, but we call them FEM cells,
and their existence is entirely different.

00:06:22.076 --> 00:06:24.276
Incels have become a global threat,

00:06:25.076 --> 00:06:28.476
with many defining it as extremism
and terrorism.

00:06:29.556 --> 00:06:35.076
In 2014, Elliot Rodger stabbed and shot
dead six people in California,

00:06:35.116 --> 00:06:37.236
blaming girls who rejected him.

00:06:38.476 --> 00:06:43.356
Since then, numerous incel attacks have
been carried out under this ideology.

00:06:44.236 --> 00:06:49.396
Like Jake Davison, who in Plymouth
in 2021 murdered five people,

00:06:49.796 --> 00:06:52.556
including his mother and
a three year old girl.

00:06:54.596 --> 00:06:56.076
There's no concrete statistics,

00:06:56.076 --> 00:07:00.636
but it's believed around 100 people have
been murdered under incel ideology,

00:07:00.676 --> 00:07:02.356
mostly women and girls.

00:07:04.676 --> 00:07:08.556
FEM sells, by contrast, have been
linked to zero murders.

00:07:08.716 --> 00:07:11.756
They are largely non-violent and
they are not operating in

00:07:11.756 --> 00:07:16.716
the same militarised way. One of these
things is not like the other.

00:07:17.716 --> 00:07:20.436
Misandry is not like misogyny.

00:07:20.996 --> 00:07:24.236
We see femme sells as the
pinnacle of misandry,

00:07:24.356 --> 00:07:28.396
but actually many of them became femme
sells after experiencing traumatic

00:07:28.396 --> 00:07:32.316
relationships with men, and they
felt safer just withdrawing.

00:07:34.636 --> 00:07:38.796
So misandry has become a popular
buzzword in modern culture,

00:07:39.276 --> 00:07:44.156
and it's been given legitimacy in academia
that has trickled down into

00:07:44.156 --> 00:07:46.956
incel chatrooms and far
right circles online.

00:07:47.636 --> 00:07:53.636
However, despite this, there's very few
explorations of what misandry is what

00:07:53.676 --> 00:07:58.676
does exist. Accepts it as
the inverse of misogyny.

00:07:58.916 --> 00:08:02.556
The dictionary definition literally
presents them as the same.

00:08:04.316 --> 00:08:09.116
For example, there's a book called
Spreading Misandry The Teaching of

00:08:09.116 --> 00:08:11.356
Contempt for men. In popular culture.

00:08:12.596 --> 00:08:18.356
The authors Paul Nathanson and Katherine
Young in it say that unlike misogyny,

00:08:18.396 --> 00:08:23.996
misandry is acceptable in society
both morally and legally.

00:08:25.316 --> 00:08:31.156
That's laughable to me. How could anyone
say that misogyny is unacceptable in

00:08:31.156 --> 00:08:33.476
society when it's everywhere?

00:08:33.836 --> 00:08:37.916
It's in our homes, it's on our TVs,
it's in our newsrooms,

00:08:37.956 --> 00:08:40.916
it's in our police forces. It's
on our social media feeds.

00:08:42.196 --> 00:08:47.236
Misandry, by contrast, is practically
invisible both in popular culture

00:08:47.236 --> 00:08:52.876
and the real world. But let's take their
statement and see if it's real.

00:08:53.556 --> 00:08:55.836
Can we answer the following questions?

00:08:57.516 --> 00:09:02.996
Can you name a country where young boys
are legally allowed to marry adult women?

00:09:05.996 --> 00:09:09.396
Where 1 in 3 men are sexually
assaulted by a woman.

00:09:12.036 --> 00:09:15.396
Where the majority of men are
murdered by women, not men.

00:09:17.916 --> 00:09:20.076
Where men cannot wear what they like.

00:09:22.076 --> 00:09:25.236
Where men cannot leave their homes
without a female chaperone.

00:09:27.796 --> 00:09:31.356
Where women dictate what jobs
men can and cannot do.

00:09:32.916 --> 00:09:36.276
The answer to all these questions is no.

00:09:37.116 --> 00:09:39.796
But when we reverse it
and look at misogyny,

00:09:39.796 --> 00:09:43.396
the answers are a harrowing
and resounding yes.

00:09:44.116 --> 00:09:46.036
In recent years in the UK,

00:09:46.236 --> 00:09:49.596
a woman has been killed by a man
on average every three days.

00:09:51.756 --> 00:09:55.876
Male violence against women is a leading
cause of premature death

00:09:55.876 --> 00:09:57.116
for women globally.

00:10:00.676 --> 00:10:02.476
This year alone in the UK,

00:10:02.476 --> 00:10:04.636
the number of women whose
deaths have led to

00:10:04.636 --> 00:10:07.156
a man being charged has now exceeded 50.

00:10:08.116 --> 00:10:12.156
The actual number will be considerably
higher. This is just who's been charged.

00:10:15.036 --> 00:10:18.676
Between 2022 and 2023, in the
north east of England,

00:10:18.676 --> 00:10:21.796
72% of domestic abuse victims were women.

00:10:25.036 --> 00:10:29.356
About 90% of homicide suspects
in England and Wales are men.

00:10:31.516 --> 00:10:34.876
So when we look at all the evidence,
the truth is,

00:10:34.916 --> 00:10:38.676
is that women do not hate men
the way that men hate women.

00:10:39.676 --> 00:10:43.956
Misandry is not a threat because at worst
it hurts some men's feelings.

00:10:43.996 --> 00:10:47.156
Misogyny, on the other hand,
kills people daily.

00:10:47.796 --> 00:10:50.436
The oppressed cannot oppress
the oppressor.

00:10:51.916 --> 00:10:54.436
I'm not telling you all this
just to depress you.

00:10:55.036 --> 00:10:58.836
I want you to leave today and push back
up against these unhelpful narratives

00:10:58.836 --> 00:11:02.956
and red herrings. Because misandry
is so often brought up as

00:11:02.956 --> 00:11:06.756
a way to distract women talking
about very real misogyny.

00:11:07.076 --> 00:11:10.516
It is what aboutism and almost
always a red flag.

00:11:10.516 --> 00:11:12.676
We must not equate the two things.

00:11:13.116 --> 00:11:17.716
It invalidates and disrespects all the
people who have been abused, harmed,

00:11:17.716 --> 00:11:20.556
murdered under misogynistic violence.

00:11:22.116 --> 00:11:25.996
Misandry is a myth, and those who try

00:11:25.996 --> 00:11:29.436
and drum up hysteria about it
are disinformation actors.

00:11:30.436 --> 00:11:31.436
Thank you.

00:11:33.236 --> 00:11:34.516
Well, thank you.

